    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i guess i've spent my whole life terrified of decline. of losing the sharpness, the passion... just becoming someone who talks about what they *used* to be. there's a certain kind of peace in the idea of just wrapping it all up while it still means something. like, why wait for the music to turn into noise?",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
